# Vigil Unified Cloud Bridge — Focus Spec (Phase 1+)

**Status:** SPEC / PLANNING ONLY — no implementation until the user starts execution.  
**Goal:** One Vigil identity & conversation continuum: discuss anywhere (web) → save Plan → open desktop → **Execute** with full history — without re-explaining. Beat Cursor’s “desktop-only / re-brief the agent” pain.  
**Related:** `.cursor/rules/00-الخطة-العامة-والأولويات.mdc`, `.cursor/rules/01-وضع-التخطيط-Plan-Mode.mdc`  
**Web project contract (portable):** `.cursor/rules/03-عقد-مشروع-الويب.mdc` — copy into the separate Vigil Web repo when that work starts.  
**Support / DB Copilot:** `.cursor/rules/04-دعم-فني-وقواعد-البيانات.mdc` — SQL Server + Postgres for support personas (desktop connector; web UX).  
**Hard constraint:** **Never upload project source trees / workspace files to Firestore.** Cloud holds account, billing, chats, plans, usage. Desktop tools touch the local repo only.

