## 5. Desktop embedding of Vigil Web (same carbon UI)

- [ ] Host Vigil Web inside desktop via **WebView / iframe / embedded browser tab** (reuse Vigil Browser patterns where fit)  
- [ ] Same origin session / token bridge so login isn’t duplicated awkwardly  
- [ ] Chat history in the embed === web history (Firestore)  
- [ ] Desktop chrome around embed: local workspace, agent Execute, terminal, LSP  
- [ ] Clear UX: “Cloud chat” (web shell) vs “Local agent run” (tools)  
- [ ] Fallback: native chat UI that reads Firestore if embed unavailable — still cloud SoR  

