## 6. Firestore hub (SoR domains)

- [ ] `users` / `orgs` / roles  
- [ ] `packages`, `subscriptions`, `wallets`, `usageEvents`  
- [ ] `chats`, `messages`  
- [ ] `projects` (web-side project folders for chats/plans)  
- [ ] `libraryItems`  
- [ ] `plans` (portable artifact; syncable)  
- [ ] `schedules` (optional Phase 1.5)  
- [ ] `devices` / sessions  
- [ ] Security rules: own-data; admin elevated  

**Never in Firestore:** repo source, git objects, deep index.

