## 7. Continuum behaviors

> **عربي:** قسم — Sync

### Sync
- [ ] All first-party chat/plan writes go to Firestore when online  
- [ ] Desktop + web always load from Firestore as primary  
- [ ] Optional local cache warm on launch; invalidate on cloud newer `updatedAt`  
- [ ] Agent coding tools never blocked by chat sync failures (queue cloud writes)

> **عربي:** قسم — Plan handoff

### Plan handoff
- [ ] Approve on web → visible on desktop (embed or native)  
- [ ] **Execute** runs local sidecar tools  
- [ ] Status mirrored to Firestore for phone follow-up  

> **عربي:** قياس الاستهلاك والمحفظة

### Metering
- [ ] One wallet across web + desktop + all enabled models + **unlimited devices** (same account)

> **عربي:** قسم — Billing & identity continuum (see `03-عقد-مشروع-الويب.mdc` §2.3 + §2.4 + §5)

### Billing & identity continuum (see `03-عقد-مشروع-الويب.mdc` §2.3 + §2.4 + §5)
- [ ] User Web **Pricing → packages → checkout → auto activate** paid/partner in Firestore + Admin ledger  
- [ ] **Free/trial** starter tokens for a configurable period  
- [ ] Desktop EXE **opens Web login** → handoff back → account activated on desktop  
- [ ] **Egypt local rails (must):** Card+Meeza, InstaPay (API), wallets (VF/Orange/e&/WE), Fawry reference — not Stripe-only; no manual transfer screenshots  

